playtime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741780/extras/1fb7d1422ed2efd7571b7e6c69284f55.avif?t=1754862349\" data-has-big width=800 height=1413 /></span> </p>",
    "short_description": "A surreal slice-of-life about a mysterious computer virus and its effects on the city you live in. Navigate day-to-day decisions, fall in love with your coworker, and alienate your customers by being rude in this dystopian desert ring-\u2018em-up \u2014 featuring graphics created with a Game Boy Camera!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cCompletely and undeniably compelling\u201d<br>8.5 \u2013 Way Too Many Games<br><br>\u201cGas Station Story is more than a game, it\u2019s a work of art\u201d<br>Gayming Mag<br><br>\u201cafter playing for 15 minutes and being sworn at by an alien who I wouldn't sell cigarettes to, I'm so intrigued that I can't stop\u201d<br>Retro Dodo<br>",
